    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Estate Agents are delighted to present 13 Rinawade Lawns, a wonderful, spacious 4 bedroom/3 bathroom semi-detached home which measures an impressive 136 sq.m/1,464 sq.ft. This home boasts a sunny south west facing garden to the rear ensuring the home is flooded with natural light. The rear garden boasts both a large 28 sq.m Annexe which has been transformed into a home bar, entertainment suite along with a 16 sq.m steel shed currently used as a home gym.\n\n13 Rinawade Lawns is situated in a very mature & quiet location just perfect for families. The large driveway to the front provides plenty of off street parking along with a gated pedestrian side access to the rear. This is a turnkey opportunity for those wishing to put down roots in a very popular and convenient part of Leixlip.\n\nAccommodation downstairs comprises of entrance hallway, guest wc, large living room with inter-connecting doors to the dining room, an office/family room and a kitchen/breakfast room to the rear with a separate utility. Upstairs is equally as impressive with a bathroom and four generously proportioned bedrooms, with the master bedroom ensuite.\n\nThe rear garden is an exceptionally sunny south west orientation which is low maintenance and benefits from a large 28 sq.m annexe. For those working from home, this could easily be transitioned into a home office. The garden further benefits from a 16 sq.m steel shed (which is fully wired) to the side along with gated pedestrian side access.\n\n13 Rinawade Lawns is ideally located adjacent to a large recreational green area within this highly sought-after residential development and located just minutes from Leixlip village with its host of eateries, pubs and shops. Fantastic schools, sports and leisure facilities are all within close proximity. Louisa Bridge train station, bus facilities and the N4/M4/M50 are also within striking distance.\n\nCall Audrey Higgins to arrange an appointment on 01 6280400 as viewings will be strong for this wonderful home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 1.86m x 4m\nWide entrance hallway with tiled flooring, ceiling coving and ceiling cornicing\n\nWC - 1.14m x 1.2m\nWith wc and whb\n\nOffice/Family room - 2.39m x 4.71m\nLarge side room with wood flooring and coving\n\nLiving Room - 4m x 4.92m\nSpacious master bedroom to the front with wood flooring, gas fire, tv point, ceiling coving, ceiling centre rose and double doors connecting to the dining room\n\nDining Room - 2.88m x 4.6m\nLarge dining room to the rear with wood flooring\n\nKitchen/Breakfast room - 2.99m x 6.93m\nBright kitchen with a modern fitted kitchen, gas hob and tiled flooring\n\nUtility Room - 1.94m x 1.9m\nWith counter, tiled flooring and plumbing for washing machine\n\nLanding - 1.96m x 3.62m\nWith Stira stairs to attic, hot linen press and carpeted flooring\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.27m x 4.37m\nLarge master bedroom to the front with ensuite shower room, built in wardobes and carpeted flooring\n\nEnsuite - 2m x 1.45m\nTiled ensuite with shower, wc and whb\n\nBedroom 2 - 3m x 3.64m\nLarge double bedroom to the rear with built in wardrobes and carpeted floooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.85m x 2.52m\nSingle bedroom to the rear with built in wardrobes and carpeted flooring\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.69m x 2.8m\nSingle bedroom to the front with carpeted flooring and built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 1.85m x 1.95m\nFully tiled bathroom with bath, wc and whb\n\n"
      },
